{"schemaVersion":1,"records":[["open-caocao-94fe4f876ed182ba1bb9","詩",["遊覽君山，景色極為真切。","山勢高聳崎嶇，你自以為是神靈。","於是來到王母宮台，","金階玉砌，殿堂華麗，","芝草在殿旁生長，","東邊西邊廂房，","賓客坐滿廳堂，","主人舉杯行酒，","在座的人祝願長壽，快樂何止盡頭。","長樂宮剛開始，正宜於子孫繁衍，","常願主人增添年歲，","與天長地久相守。"],"3096c29b0001c545f27e5148b1ddbab5290c457f09be46174250659842e914f0",{"quality":"machine-draft-unreviewed","status":"pending-review","sourceLabel":"Leafbound AI 今譯 · 初步可用","displayStatus":"待人工校訂","productionReady":false,"model":"Qwen3.5-9B-Local","modelRevision":"local-deployment-2026-08-29","promptVersion":"leafbound-classical-v2","warnings":["paragraph-count-mismatch"],"generatedAt":"2026-08-29T12:12:08.749Z","editorialTriage":"initially-usable","review":{"reviewer":"Leafbound owner","reviewedAt":"2026-08-29T14:00:00.000Z","note":"初步抽查通過；仍待逐篇精校。"}}],["open-nalan-0a3e072a33dcc505028f","詞",["海天之間，是誰讓那冰輪圓滿地懸掛起來？","心中充滿了離別的愁緒。","不要説起離別的情懷。","只要遇到美好的夜晚，總免不了淚流滿面。","只希望在那碧藍的蒼天之上，我們能再次相見。","那將是來世的緣分。","無奈這今生，","剛剛開始愁苦時，又想起了你。"],"2683aece21487dc1f8bf46e301f373f317981ba0b53769bd8ba766606ae798e5",{"quality":"machine-draft-unreviewed","status":"pending-review","sourceLabel":"Leafbound AI 今譯 · 初步可用","displayStatus":"待人工校訂","productionReady":false,"model":"Qwen3.5-9B-Local","modelRevision":"local-deployment-2026-08-29","promptVersion":"leafbound-classical-v2","warnings":[],"generatedAt":"2026-08-29T12:15:48.019Z","editorialTriage":"initially-usable","review":{"reviewer":"Leafbound owner","reviewedAt":"2026-08-29T14:00:00.000Z","note":"初步抽查通過；仍待逐篇精校。"}}]]}
